"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","review_id":"pDE-wWPnw3Miiqpl76H9lA","date":"2015-10-05T02:21:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9399257302284241,"text_excerpt":"We thought this place is fantastic. Here me out. We do watch Bar Rescue, and stopped in on a whim. Our expectations were fairly low, but this place is legit. The dueling pianos are great. The musicians are great and hilarious. Someone bought me their signature coctail, The Resurrection, and it's not half bad! We ended up filling the souvenir glass with bourbon and Coke the rest of the night but love it still. We met the owners briefly and also got a shot from a lovely bar tender in front barber's chair. Give it a try!"},{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","review_id":"ke5VyX0Dl_IkuZoZDOebmw","date":"2017-05-28T18:59:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9304707050323486,"text_excerpt":"Spirits was one of the few bars where we stayed and hung out for awhile. The bartenders were FAST and friendly. My favorite drink was the barber beer.. It kind of tastes like an adult cream soda. The one night we came in there were dueling pianos. Overall a good time, fun atmosphere, nice staff! Can't wait to visit again next time we go to New Orleans!"},{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","review_id":"C5l164mEzmPIF0Q_abj-PA","date":"2016-12-22T15:35:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9253765344619751,"text_excerpt":"Super fun place in the midst of all the Bourbon Street festivities. Went there on my most recent trip to NOLA with a few friends, one of which was celebrating a birthday. Dueling piano's going at it, with both pianists taking requests, none of which I believe were denied!!! Place was about half full when we walked in but as the evening progressed, the crowd got thicker, the drinks got stiffer, (or at least they seemed too), and the barber chair was workin' on max RPM's!!! The pianists there that night were pretty freakin' talented and to be honest, funnier that $hit!!! These guys kept us entertained for quite some time. FUC'd around quite a bit with our celebrant as well as another that w..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","photo_id":"DTGooj_4pnrRJVyVd661PQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/DTGooj_4pnrRJVyVd661PQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9187120199203491},{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","photo_id":"e1xIZU23u7LqaxN203Mx3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/e1xIZU23u7LqaxN203Mx3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.78990638256073},{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","photo_id":"2yx5_lK-SwWdzNdHZcwqUA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2yx5_lK-SwWdzNdHZcwqUA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7874415516853333},{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","photo_id":"48ZkfnJsygKydVpCVPS5cg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/48ZkfnJsygKydVpCVPS5cg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7716274857521057},{"business_id":"eD018QIwrljtaF4Dqe0A6Q","photo_id":"UFT_edupUQUBuMi189-gLg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UFT_edupUQUBuMi189-gLg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7169733643531799}]},"notebook_case":null}
